# What Prettier leaves alone (it also skips what .gitignore lists, and node_modules).
# The desktop app, a package of its own, has its own list: desktop/.prettierignore.

# Docs: written by hand, their tables and line breaks as they are.
*.md

# Written by npm, or by a program of ours: never by hand.
package-lock.json
src/web/public/manifest.webmanifest
src/web/public/icons/

# Recorded from the real CLIs: replayed byte for byte.
test/fixtures/

# The landing page's HTML: its whitespace and JSON-LD as written (site/DESIGN-GUIDELINES.md), and
# the search engines' verification files, which must stay byte for byte.
site/**/*.html
